<p style="font-size:14px;">
  <strong><%= @organization.name %></strong> just started a subscription before the DSCSA deadline,
  so they get White-Glove Setup free (<%= DeadlineOffer.value_label %> value).
</p>
<p style="font-size:14px;">Reach out and book the setup call:</p>
<ul style="font-size:14px;">
  <% @users.each do |user| %>
    <li><%= mail_to user.email %> (<%= user.role %>)</li>
  <% end %>
</ul>
<p style="font-size:14px;">
  Mark it done on <%= link_to "/ops", ops_url(anchor: "free-setups") %> once the setup is finished.
</p>
